?page "RSVSCR - Reserve Entry/Inquiry Screen"
?section IDENTIFICATION
*
*  SCREEN NAME:   RSVSCR
*  DESCRIPTION:   Workers' Compensation Reserve Entry and Inquiry Screen
*  SYSTEM:        Claims Management System (CMS)
*  PATHWAY:       CLMSRV (Claims Server Class)
*  AUTHOR:        TPA Systems Development
*  DATE:          2024-06-15
*  MODIFIED:      2025-01-22 - Added S&S reserve category per NCCI update
*
*  This screen provides adjusters with reserve entry, inquiry, and
*  modification capabilities for all WC reserve categories. Authority
*  levels are enforced based on user profile and jurisdiction rules.
*  All reserve changes are logged to the reserve transaction file.
*
?section DATA
*
